{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Tenpou Suikoden NEO","The anime is based off an old Japanese story, which in turn was inspired by the classic Chinese novel Suikoden (Water Margin).\n\n\nIn the original story, a large band of outlaws are given amnesty by the government to fight foreign forces and rebels. The Tenpou Suidoken version relocates the story to the Chiba Prefecture town of Tonosho, and it revolves around the chivalrous battles of Sasagawa no Shigezou and Iioka Sukegorou.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["天保水滸伝NEO",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-17353","ids":{"shikimori":17353,"mal":17353,"anilist":17353,"kodik":"serial-27829"},"kodikIds":["serial-27829"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27829":"2020-07-16T05:16:04Z"},"title":"Речные заводи эпохи Тэмпо","originalTitle":"Tenpou Suikoden Neo","alt":"天保水滸伝NEO","description":"Аниме базируется на старинной японской истории, на написание которой вдохновил классический китайский роман «Речные заводи». В оригинальной истории большая группа преступников была амнистирована правительством, чтобы бороться с иностранными захватчиками и мятежниками. В версии Tenpou Suikoden Neo действие происходит в городе Тоносё префектуры Тиба, и в центре внимания рыцарские сражения Сигэдзо Сасагавы и Иоки Сукэгоро.","year":2013,"type":"TV","genres":["исторический"],"rating":4.71,"popularity":442,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/17353/d4b1bba6edbaa32afcdf9df0983bfa81.jpeg","width":500,"height":500},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/17353/d4b1bba6edbaa32afcdf9df0983bfa81.jpeg","width":500,"height":500}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-605","dubId":"605","label":"Люб. Двухголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provid